   SuperscriptBox["Z", "'"], TraditionalForm]],
  FormatType->TraditionalForm,ExpressionUUID->
  "a0e661f0-c2fb-4b19-990b-a618645c4323"],
 " (Vector Portal with X Dirac fermion)"
}], "Section",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.981878959721896*^9, 
  3.9818790242625017`*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"20d63d4d-243e-4977-8710-\
14a7b9d46580"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "To get the same p-wave contribution as in the \
https://arxiv.org/pdf/1602.08490 paper, I did have to drop the longitudinal \
modes of ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SuperscriptBox["Z", "'"], TraditionalForm]],
  FormatType->TraditionalForm,ExpressionUUID->
  "eebef87a-8e0f-49d5-96e5-34ff4144bb00"],
 " and only consider the transverse mode contribution. I realize this is \
equivalent to considering an Higgsed dark sector where Ward identities ensure \
these terms cancel."
}], "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.981882333912623*^9, 3.981882431256609*^9}, {
  3.981882479655787*^9, 
  3.981882508018318*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"ec8a8dcd-5a84-4208-8eec-\
2f4e42b41904"],

